en":["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/brand-trend-2026.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/brand-trend-2026-500x281.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/brand-trend-2026-768x432.png 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/brand-trend-2026.png","mediaDetails":{"width":1400,"height":787}},"layout":"fill","lazy":false}]}]}],false]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__jY2p_","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>If 2025 was the “oh god, AI is everywhere” panic phase, 2026 is the year brands have to answer a harder question:</p>\n<blockquote><p><em>When everything can be generated, what makes your brand feel like it was made on purpose?</em></p></blockquote>\n<p>Across trend reports, awards annuals, and case studies, the same signals keep popping up: tactility, motion, locality, and a calmer, more intentional relationship with AI. The brands that win are the ones that feel the <em>most human</em> inside a very digital world.</p>\n<p>This is our tour through those shifts.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 8f7bd458-f5f6-4f5a-b567-a5dec26f80e2 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1e"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/camera-roll-graphic-1400x788.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/camera-roll-graphic-500x281.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/camera-roll-graphic-768x432.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/camera-roll-graphic.webp 1520w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/camera-roll-graphic.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":1520,"height":855}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: Branding by </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.behance.net/MeriCenteno\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1338518973\">María Centeno</span></a><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"2\"> via Behance</span><!-- notionvc: bd60f90a-a2a1-411a-a043-a212cc80ae1f --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1f"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/candid-camera-1400x944.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/candid-camera-500x337.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/candid-camera-768x518.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/candid-camera.jpg 1510w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/candid-camera.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1510,"height":1018}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: Branding by </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.behance.net/DavyDenduyver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-253313942\">Davy Denduyver</span></a><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"2\"> via Behance</span><!-- notionvc: 5b2a72bb-834e-4cb2-ac8c-ca55da90e05a --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Oliver Li’s illustration work is all soft edges, fuzzy textures, and rich colour—exactly the kind of “digital but touchable” art direction brands are gravitating towards for campaigns and hero visuals. </span><!-- notionvc: 950544d3-96db-4a3f-9ee8-dc2567ea30dd --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Oliver-Yingjie-Li-Li-1400x969.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Oliver-Yingjie-Li-Li-500x346.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Oliver-Yingjie-Li-Li-768x532.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Oliver-Yingjie-Li-Li-1536x1063.jpg 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Oliver-Yingjie-Li-Li.jpg 1888w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Oliver-Yingjie-Li-Li.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1888,"height":1307}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\"> Source: </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.creativeboom.com/inspiration/oliver-yingjie-li-li/?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1366809645\">Creative Boom – Oliver Li</span></a><!-- notionvc: 5957fcd7-ba4e-464c-92ff-9f1132779aa8 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Dutch illustrator Ellis Tolsma’s riso prints are a perfect example of tactile, imperfect graphics: misregistration, heavy grain, and overprinted colours that feel more like a screen-printed gig poster than digital art. </span><!-- notionvc: a7787719-5fcd-4287-b4c3-81d8da3b8931 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma-1093x1400.jpeg 1093w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma-1562x2000.jpeg 1562w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma-390x500.jpeg 390w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma-768x984.jpeg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma-1199x1536.jpeg 1199w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma-1599x2048.jpeg 1599w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma.jpeg 1888w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/ellis-tolsma.jpeg","mediaDetails":{"width":1888,"height":2418}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.creativeboom.com/inspiration/playfulness-imperfection-retro-vibes-enter-the-creative-world-of-ellis-tolsma/?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--419231642\">Creative Boom – Ellis Tolsma risoprints</span></a><!-- notionvc: ea70d901-1784-4264-9b60-7250540eb177 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Collage has caught the same bug, messy in all the right ways. Tyler Upchurch’s work, for instance, mixes ripped textures, jagged layers, fractured photos and surreal cut-and-paste in a way that feels closer to a DIY zine than a neat layout.<!-- notionvc: 6b5d56ba-c910-4f87-9e5d-364e83b6fb76 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/tyler-upchurch-1400x583.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/tyler-upchurch-500x208.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/tyler-upchurch-768x320.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/tyler-upchurch-1536x639.webp 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/tyler-upchurch.webp 1913w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/tyler-upchurch.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":1913,"height":796}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: Illustrations by </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.tylerupchurch.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--1534931060\">Tyler Upchurch</span></a><!-- notionvc: 904b87f8-9d72-4bb8-90a9-27ce6008a772 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$20"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4-1120x1400.webp 1120w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4-1600x2000.webp 1600w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4-400x500.webp 400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4-768x960.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4-1229x1536.webp 1229w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4-1638x2048.webp 1638w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4.webp 2000w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Jolene-Bakery-Studio-Frith-03-bc9e4.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":2000,"height":2500}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: Studio Frith’s identity for Jolene Bakery embraces childlike anarchy &#8211; <a href=\"https://the-brandidentity.com/project/studio-friths-identity-for-jolene-bakery-embraces-childlike-anarchy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Brand Identity</a></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>2. Hyper-local, folk and heritage-coded identities</h2>\n<p>A second 2026 signal: brands are getting <strong>very specific</strong> about roots, context and visual heritage.</p>\n<p>Logo and graphic trend reports are full of folklore, “elemental folk” motifs, and story-led marks. VistaPrint’s 2026 logo-trends piece opens with “Storybook Gothic”: moon phases, enchanted flora, medieval letterforms and talismanic seals.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 2de613b1-95f0-4ec6-b187-cbeef9fd54bf --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/sapling-growing.webp 993w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/sapling-growing-500x466.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/sapling-growing-768x715.webp 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/sapling-growing.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":993,"height":925}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: logo by </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://99designs.co.uk/profiles/3436150\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--52733502\">eva.fontana</span></a><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"2\"> via 99designs</span><!-- notionvc: 7c2133aa-4ac4-45ab-926c-9b5c38e51453 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Hellebore-1400x885.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Hellebore-500x316.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Hellebore-768x486.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Hellebore-1536x971.webp 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Hellebore.webp 1914w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Hellebore.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":1914,"height":1210}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://blackmoonbotanica.com/products/hellebore-magazine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-679597868\">Hellebore Magazine </span></a><!-- notionvc: 4df2fd0b-e6b9-434f-bbe0-b3c290575872 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>The graphic-trend roundups are circling two big moods: <strong>Elemental Folk</strong>, with its nature-soaked motifs, folklore references and craft-driven textures; and <strong>hyper-individualism</strong>, where visuals lean into personal histories, local symbols and those “only we would choose this” design decisions that make a brand feel unmistakably its own.</p>\n<p>The Albert Hall’s wordmark is a perfect example of <strong>modern</strong> <strong>heritage branding</strong>: history remixed rather than reverently preserved. It pulls from the building’s Victorian foundations, then threads in the bold typography of the ’60s and ’70s. It’s honouring its history without getting stuck in it — contemporary, but with the dust left on in all the right places.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: e1a99aa9-be21-4223-be21-c8dbf71a12c5 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/df14cc8d39944858bda6df75d813ccaea423c7fa_1888-1400x933.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/df14cc8d39944858bda6df75d813ccaea423c7fa_1888-500x333.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/df14cc8d39944858bda6df75d813ccaea423c7fa_1888-768x512.png 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/df14cc8d39944858bda6df75d813ccaea423c7fa_1888-1536x1023.png 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/df14cc8d39944858bda6df75d813ccaea423c7fa_1888.png 1888w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/df14cc8d39944858bda6df75d813ccaea423c7fa_1888.png","mediaDetails":{"width":1888,"height":1258}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.creativeboom.com/news/brandpie-gives-the-royal-albert-hall-a-refreshed-identity-rooted-in-heritage-and-modernity/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--919236508\">Creative Boom</span></a><!-- notionvc: 5bf34f89-b263-45ca-a89f-2c005d4edd2e --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>For brands, this means:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mining your <strong>actual origin stories</strong> – the building you started in, the city you came from, the tools you use, the in-jokes from your category – and turning them into visual assets.</li>\n<li>Creating alt logos, seals, patterns and icons that feel <em>rooted</em> somewhere, not designed in a vacuum.</li>\n<li>Using photography that shows real context and community, not default stock.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In a world where AI can fake generic “cool”, the assets that land are the ones with <strong>specificity baked in</strong>: a tiny mascot tied to a local myth, a pattern lifted from real machinery or street signage, a secondary logo that only makes sense if you know your history.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: ede3164d-0a24-439a-a2f8-577490df4ce9 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-1400x788.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-500x281.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-768x432.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-2048x1152.jpg 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/07-UPP-MainCTA-2560x1440.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":2880,"height":1620}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],null]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[false,["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_video__krg5m","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L22",null,{"src":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/04/times-1.mp4","layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://kota.co.uk/work/upp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"0\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--825758820\">UPP by KOTA</span></a><!-- notionvc: cf8d8b9d-d398-4e7c-8c22-8b5c0e22a16c --></p>\n"}}]]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$23"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-12.02.29-1400x919.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-12.02.29-500x328.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-12.02.29-768x504.png 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-12.02.29-1536x1008.png 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-12.02.29.png 1676w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-12.02.29.png","mediaDetails":{"width":1676,"height":1100}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://dribbble.com/polinadubenko\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--340532254\">Polina Dubenko</span></a><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"2\"> on Dribbble. </span><!-- notionvc: 27d864d4-11e8-4128-a26a-2a19691a8757 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$24"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/charliexcx.png 724w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/charliexcx-500x250.png 500w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/charliexcx.png","mediaDetails":{"width":724,"height":362}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a href=\"https://www.nylon.com/entertainment/charli-xcx-john-cale-house\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Nylon</a></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>What makes this revival feel distinct in 2026 is that it isn’t about darkness for darkness’ sake. It’s about heightened feeling. Tragedy, longing, danger, devotion — all the big, messy emotions that ultra-clean tech design spent a decade scrubbing out. Gothic gives brands permission to be dramatic again. To be strange. To be deeply felt.</p>\n<p>Think Gothic type layered over soft, dreamy pastels — romantic, eerie. It taps into that wider gothic rebirth happening right now, where design is in that <strong>sweet spot between beauty and unease.</strong></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>5. Colour, nostalgia and emotional palettes<!-- notionvc: e94fa491-253c-4f19-9cfc-330c65825a0c --></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.co.uk/hub/graphic-design-trends\"><em>Neon-Noir</em></a> bleeds together high-contrast reds, blacks and electric neons to create that moody, cinematic grit you’d normally find in a rainy-night thriller. In the same breath, we’re also seeing glossy gradients, bubble-like highlights and blue-sky optimism borrowed straight from the early-2000s techno-utopia era, and a sugary remix of Y2K sparkles, system fonts and nostalgic glitch motion.</p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a-1400x1050.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a-2000x1500.webp 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a-500x375.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a-768x576.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a-1536x1152.webp 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a.webp 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/original-a8f4c4bea26cadafc138b9a02997658a.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":2048,"height":1536}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://dribbble.com/polinadubenko\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--340532254\">Polina Dubenko</span></a><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"2\"> on Dribbble <em>via <a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.co.uk/hub/graphic-design-trends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vistaprint </a></em></span><!-- notionvc: 632f9c4c-e105-495f-9010-7c2cf7cea23c --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$25"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/DesignTrend_NeonNoir_3-1400x849.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/DesignTrend_NeonNoir_3-500x303.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/DesignTrend_NeonNoir_3-768x465.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/DesignTrend_NeonNoir_3-1536x931.webp 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/DesignTrend_NeonNoir_3.webp 1876w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/DesignTrend_NeonNoir_3.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":1876,"height":1137}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><em>Source: Website design by <a href=\"https://99designs.co.uk/profiles/1256263\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\" data-section=\"Content:Text Link\" data-position=\"77\" data-translation=\"vyncadq\">vyncadq</a> via <a href=\"https://www.vistaprint.co.uk/hub/graphic-design-trends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Vistaprint </a></em></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>6. Controlled chaos: anti-design, broken grids and zine energy</h2>\n<p>Controlled chaos is having a moment. It&#8217;s the sort of thing that looks feral at first glance but, on closer inspection, is running on a very intentional pulse. Brutalism, anti-design and collage-driven layouts are a major thread, especially for culture, youth and experimental brands.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: c79d1444-a13a-46b5-8bce-c86745841fd6 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.42.43.png 556w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.42.43-285x500.png 285w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.42.43.png","mediaDetails":{"width":556,"height":974}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.itsnicethat.com/articles/wieden-and-kennedy-amsterdam-foam-graphic-design-project-241125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1406116284\">It’s Nice That</span></a>. Wieden+Kennedy Amsterdam: Foam Talent Call, (Copyright © Wieden+Kennedy Amsterdam, 2025)<!-- notionvc: e25cd2f7-7ca9-4fc5-a29d-46e428cb38ad --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>We keep seeing these trends through default system fonts, harsh asymmetry and layouts that feel purposely unpolished. Even broken grids that we’re seeing in web design — snapping away from perfect centring to create tension and momentum — capture that broader shift away from immaculate modernism.<!-- notionvc: af9e7b18-9ad8-4c2a-923d-022ff73774b2 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592-1400x1050.webp 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592-2000x1500.webp 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592-500x375.webp 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592-768x576.webp 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592-1536x1152.webp 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592.webp 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/2d3e768c351ef7c178bdaf71d81f3592.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":2048,"height":1536}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: </span><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"1\">Ghia’s </span><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"2\">Collage-like layout on </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://dribbble.com/shots/26375242-Ghia-Colorful-Bold-Non-Alcoholic-Beverage-Company-Website-Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"3\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--142127848\">Dribbble</span></a><!-- notionvc: c2a53bef-c654-4599-ad38-bbecd4f1bce4 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>We’re also seeing a collage-heavy aesthetic where type tangles with imagery, tape and staples become compositional elements, and pages feel closer to protest posters or DIY zines than anything you’d find in a corporate brand book. It’s the visual language of brands that <span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"1\">want</span> to feel a bit ungovernable.<!-- notionvc: 8c97993d-741c-4819-a266-f802a05e304a --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/MFNnvowRBzu4L6soGMtpM9-1200-80.jpg.webp 1200w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/MFNnvowRBzu4L6soGMtpM9-1200-80.jpg-476x500.webp 476w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/MFNnvowRBzu4L6soGMtpM9-1200-80.jpg-768x806.webp 768w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/MFNnvowRBzu4L6soGMtpM9-1200-80.jpg.webp","mediaDetails":{"width":1200,"height":1260}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Designs for The Social, a two-storey bar in central London, by Insect (Image credit: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://cargocollective.com/lukeinsect/Info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--1208461423\">Luke Insect</span></a>) Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.creativebloq.com/features/rebirth-of-the-zine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"3\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--721303552\">It’s Nice That</span></a>. <!-- notionvc: d336b2dd-1bf3-4eef-a888-d67f384bf2a5 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Beneath the ripped edges and off-kilter grids, there’s almost always a defined type stack, a tight colour system, and non-negotiables for legibility and accessibility. The riot is aesthetic — the infrastructure is still calm.</p>\n<p>So if you’re flirting with anti-design in 2026, get specific. Where does the chaos live — campaigns, editorial content, event microsites, merch? And where must calm prevail — logo handling, checkout flows, contrast ratios?</p>\n<p>Most importantly: will your audience read this as confident disruption, or as a brand that hasn’t ironed its shirt? A beautifully designed riot is absolutely on-trend for 2026, but it needs to be one you can control.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: f144cc1b-06ee-4501-a299-45842ded204e --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>7. Surveillance Aesthetic / CCTV Tech Dystopia</h2>\n<p>Running parallel to this is the growing <strong>surveillance and CCTV-tech aesthetic</strong> — harsh compression artefacts, timestamp overlays, infrared green, lens distortion and security-interface typography.</p>\n<p>Fashion and culture brands are already tapping into this visual language of paranoia and control. <a href=\"https://www.balenciaga.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Balenciaga’s digital campaigns</strong></a> regularly simulate security camera footage and corrupted livestreams as part of their brand world.</p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 5a06259a-b9fc-4cdf-baea-98f5810d8a19 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":null,"sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Balenciaga-Winter-Campaign.png","mediaDetails":{"width":465,"height":237}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><span class=\"notion-enable-hover\" data-token-index=\"0\">Source: </span><a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.luxurydaily.com/balenciaga-plays-with-private-everyday-moments-in-winter-campaign/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id--481589180\">Luxury Daily</span></a><!-- notionvc: f0aa9a3e-f8e1-492f-82d1-7f4cbdacf96a --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45-1400x928.png 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45-2000x1326.png 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45-500x331.png 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45-768x509.png 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45-1536x1018.png 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45-2048x1357.png 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-26-at-11.32.45.png","mediaDetails":{"width":2236,"height":1482}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ngr.ev?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&amp;igsh=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw==\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1193090238\">ngr.ev on Instagram </span></a><!-- notionvc: e1a81165-401b-42fe-9d1b-30b741b5937e --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/02-pwr_layer-copy-1500x1001-1-1400x934.jpg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/02-pwr_layer-copy-1500x1001-1-500x334.jpg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/02-pwr_layer-copy-1500x1001-1-768x513.jpg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/02-pwr_layer-copy-1500x1001-1.jpg 1500w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/02-pwr_layer-copy-1500x1001-1.jpg","mediaDetails":{"width":1500,"height":1001}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.serpentinegalleries.org/whats-on/hito-steyerl-power-plants/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1341542121\">Serpentine</span></a></p>\n<p><!-- notionvc: 00e8a761-277d-4036-be3a-22f6d5e6eb97 --><!-- notionvc: f24c2542-3ed8-40b8-86e3-33c00de2d0a0 --></p>\n"}}]]}],false]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>In the world of art-meets-tech, <a class=\"notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/2023/jun/13/post-internet-artist-hito-steyerl-refusing-honours-big-tech\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-token-index=\"1\"><span class=\"link-annotation-unknown-block-id-232777667\">Hito Steyerl’s digital installations</span></a> remain a core reference point for glitch, compression artefacts and surveillance politics feeding directly into contemporary visual culture.</p>\n<p>This is a visual reflection of algorithmic life, data capture, and constant recording. <!-- notionvc: b75c7b40-756a-44d1-98d0-7e977995c5b9 --></p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$26"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"Text_text__jOaGN","children":["$","$L1d",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"Text_textInner__lCgQa","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V95nfAEXlZ4?si=AkjMM-Io4H4ay3TL\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>But here’s also a fascinating counter-signal cutting through all of this: <strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"299\">the hot new trend in marketing is hating on AI</strong>. Even the new Apple TV ident was built with glass and <a href=\"https://www.famouscampaigns.com/2025/11/new-apple-tv-ident-was-built-with-glass-and-shot-entirely-on-camera/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shot entirely on camera</a>. Pure practical effects. No AI, no CGI.</p>\n"}}]}]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_fullWidthMedia__NRjkh","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","figure",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_image__yCr3O","data-width":"contained","children":[["$","$L1b",null,{"image":{"altText":"","srcSet":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047-1400x903.jpeg 1400w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047-2000x1290.jpeg 2000w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047-500x323.jpeg 500w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047-768x495.jpeg 768w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047-1536x991.jpeg 1536w, https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047.jpeg 2048w","sourceUrl":"https://kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2025/11/1763375092047.jpeg","mediaDetails":{"width":2048,"height":1321}},"layout":"intrinsic"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"className":"FullWidthMedia_caption__QeGJx","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Source: <a class=\"BZlYAjikHPGRJsJDVXcEAIgyCHVdMWfWWELYvU update-compon